 "lines": [
  "Thanksgiving is national because of a nursery rhyme author.",
  "Sarah Josepha Hale wrote \"Mary Had a Little Lamb.\"",
  "Back then, each state picked its own Thanksgiving day, or skipped it.",
  "For over 15 years, she pushed for one national day in print.",
  "Her letters to Presidents Taylor, Fillmore, Pierce and Buchanan went nowhere.",
  "Then, during the Civil War, she wrote to Lincoln.",
  "Five days later, he proclaimed a national Thanksgiving for November 26th.",
  "So before you carve the turkey, remember..."
